==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|prognostick}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|ML.|-}} {{m|la|prognosticus}}, from {{der|en|grc|προγνωστικός||foreknowing}}, from {{m|grc|πρό}} + {{m|grc|γνωστικός||of or for knowing, good at knowing}}, from {{m|grc|γιγνώσκω||to learn to know, to perceive, to mark, to learn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/pɹɒɡˈnɒstɪk/|/pɹəɡˈnɒstɪk/}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of, pertaining to or characterized by [[prognosis]] or [[prediction]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|foretelling}}
* {{l|en|predictive}}

